    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1204">

                <pb facs="0852" n="736" xml:id="pg736"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/211.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Alger to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mazatlan</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-03-14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 14, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your March 13. All Americans with whom been able to communicate desire
                    representations against imposition tax Constitutionalists when already paid
                    Federals.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alger</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
